{"id":"n72082-1-9","stage":4,"title":"이득 · 得利","scene":"工作与经济","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n72082-1-9-1","ko":"그 동네 아파트 값이 엄청 올랐다지?","zh":"听说那片地区的公寓价格涨得非常厉害吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그","meaning":"那样，那个","explanation":"그：那样，那个","readings":[{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62250","senseId":"2","lemma":"그","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"}},{"text":"동네","meaning":"小区，社区，村庄","explanation":"동네：小区，社区，村庄","readings":[{"term":"동네","audio":"/audio/f97ccdfe641c28373e6c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62417","senseId":"2","lemma":"동네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"동네","audio":"/audio/f97ccdfe641c28373e6c.mp3"}},{"text":"아파트","meaning":"公寓","explanation":"아파트：公寓","readings":[{"term":"아파트","audio":"/audio/9dc94a9d71345356674e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29610","senseId":"1","lemma":"아파트","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아파트","audio":"/audio/9dc94a9d71345356674e.mp3"}},{"text":"값이","meaning":"价格，价钱","explanation":"값：价格，价钱；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"값","audio":"/audio/b19ddf94b4c9896bb5c6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20178","senseId":"1","lemma":"값","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"값이","audio":"/audio/646f3fb5806a654c4eb5.mp3"}},{"text":"엄청","meaning":"相当，特别","explanation":"엄청：相当，特别","readings":[{"term":"엄청","audio":"/audio/31ff8e60cae7be0afe40.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67346","senseId":"1","lemma":"엄청","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"엄청","audio":"/audio/31ff8e60cae7be0afe40.mp3"}},{"text":"올랐다지?","meaning":"上升，上涨","explanation":"오르다：上升，上涨；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；다지：向对方确认听说的内容，或转述并带确认语气。","readings":[{"term":"오르다","audio":"/audio/8fdeb9822b3fa0617051.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69518","senseId":"10","lemma":"오르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"올랐다지","audio":"/audio/6583a14242b5c223c6d4.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"38c61820e786f234","term":"그","zh":"那样，那个","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3","entryId":"62250","definition":"指代前面已经讲过或听话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["그"]},{"id":"f97ccdfe641c2837","term":"동네","zh":"小区，社区，村庄","audio":"/audio/f97ccdfe641c28373e6c.mp3","entryId":"62417","definition":"多户人家聚集在一起生活的地方。","pronunciation":["동ː네"]},{"id":"9dc94a9d71345356","term":"아파트","zh":"公寓","audio":"/audio/9dc94a9d71345356674e.mp3","entryId":"29610","definition":"为使多家住户可以独立地居住在同一栋高大的建筑物内而建造的住宅。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"b19ddf94b4c9896b","term":"값","zh":"价格，价钱","audio":"/audio/b19ddf94b4c9896bb5c6.mp3","entryId":"20178","definition":"给买卖的东西划定的货币数量。","pronunciation":["갑"]},{"id":"31ff8e60cae7be0a","term":"엄청","zh":"相当，特别","audio":"/audio/31ff8e60cae7be0afe40.mp3","entryId":"67346","definition":"量或程度十分过分地。","pronunciation":["엄청"]},{"id":"8fdeb9822b3fa061","term":"오르다","zh":"上升，上涨","audio":"/audio/8fdeb9822b3fa0617051.mp3","entryId":"69518","definition":"价格、数值、温度、成绩等比以前多或高。","pronunciation":["오르다"]}],"audio":"/audio/f6d7b9cf2deb08e8d7f7.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n72082-1-9-2","ko":"응, 우리 옆집도 집을 팔았는데 일억 이상 이득을 봤대.","zh":"对，我们隔壁的邻居也卖了房子，据说赚了一亿多呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}},{"text":"우리","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}},{"text":"옆집도","meaning":"邻居，隔壁","explanation":"옆집：邻居，隔壁；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"옆집","audio":"/audio/d4